; Our ISO.R32: every export forwards to the original game logic, renamed ISO_orig.dll (a forward needs the .dll name).
; Rewritten functions are switched in by patching the original (see hooks.c), so its
; internal calls reach them too. Same names and ordinals as the original.
LIBRARY ISO.R32
